9c:["$","li","li-2",{"children":["第 2 个字节 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"0x06"}]," 表示接下来的数据长度为 6 字节。既然 Tag 里的 Wire Type 是 2，解析器就知道这里必须读一个 Varint 来确定长度。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"06"}]," 就是长度。"]}]
9d:["$","li","li-3",{"children":["接下来的 6 个字节 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"4d 61 72 74 69 6e"}],"  是 ASCII 编码的字符串值 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"\"Martin\""}],"。解析器读完这 6 个字节后，知道当前字段结束，准备读取下一个 Tag。"]}]
9e:["$","li","li-4",{"children":["重点的对于数组，它们的 tag 是一样的，如上图都是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"0x1a"}],"，Protobuf 会把一样的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tag"}]," 组成数组。"]}]
